              "question": "Discuss the advantages and disadvantages of ICT in detail",
              "solution_html": "<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 my-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">Advantages and Disadvantages of ICT</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">Advantages</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Faster communication</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Easy access to information</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Improves business efficiency</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Supports online learning and remote work</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">Disadvantages</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Security and privacy issues</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• High cost of implementation</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Dependency on technology</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Risk of cybercrime</li></ul>",
              "final_answer": "• Risk of cybercrime",
              "source_exam": "Second semester BA/BSc/BVocFYUGP April 2026",
              "has_official_scheme": true
            },
            {
