              "marks": 6,
              "question": "List and explain any four advantages of MS Word.",
              "solution_html": "<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 my-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">Advantages of MS Word</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Easy document creation and editing</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Spell check and grammar tools</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Formatting features (fonts, styles, layouts)</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">• Supports images, tables, and charts</li></ul>",
              "final_answer": "• Supports images, tables, and charts",
